        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tipat e nkishomi o loosaen",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naaitoki ariku nanu ina kishomi e auluo e ine wueji sinyati, naipirare enkalo oloosaen, naa keikeno apa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naajoki ninye nanu, “Keton ena kishomi eikeno; meboli ninye, nemeeta oltung'ani ojing'u aimu ina kishomi; amu ore Olaitoriani Enkai e Israel, naa ine etijing'unye, neaku keton ninye eikeno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olkitok ake oton tiatua ninye peyie etum ainosa emukate te dukuya Olaitoriani; naa kejing ninye atua te nkoitoi olgilata le kishomi, neitoki ake aipang teina oitoi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nkitanapat naajingieki enkaji e Nkai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naariku ninye nanu aimunye enkalo e kishomi e moikuape omatabaiki enkalo e dukuya e nkaji e Nkai, naing'or naa ng'ura, eiputa enkitoo Olaitoriani e nkaji o Olaitoriani; nabatata te nkomom ai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naajoki Olaitoriani nanu, “Enkerai e tung'ani, tujurru oleng, toduaa too nkonyek inono, nining too nkiyiaa inono nena pooki naaliki iyie naaipirta inkitanapat pooki e nkaji o Laitoriani tenebo nkitanapat enyena pooki; nijurru oleng ayiolou lelo pooki ooishori metijing'a enkaji e Nkai o lelo pooki oodung'ori tewueji sinyati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nijoki ina aji kiserut, ina aji e Israel, Inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: Naaji e Israel, incho eish ilo minong lino pooki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "teine ning'amaa ilomon ile memurata too ltauja o seseni, peyie ejing ewueji ai sinyati, neisarkionie ninye, ina kata nikinchosho nanu endaa ai, nena naapir o ilo sarge. Itigila intae olning'o lai lo sotua, tenebo ilo minong linyi pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitu iramatata intokitin aainei sinyat; kake itipika ilomon meing'ura atua ewueji ai sinyati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Metaa inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: Meetae olomoni olememurata oltau o sesen lenye, o pooki omoni lelo ootii atua iltung'ana le Israel, oojing ewueji ai sinyati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etudungoyioki Ilawi te mpolosaye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kake ore lelo le Lawi laashomo aalam nanu, ootapong'ori te nanu aasuj nena kitanyaanyukot enye oo nkaitin ina kata peyie epong'ori Israel, naa kenap enkitamioto enye maate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keaku ninche ilaisiaayiak te wueji ai sinyati, neitasheiki too nkishomin e nkaji e Nkai, neisiaaisho te nkaji e Nkai; naa keyieng ninche olasar opejori te nkaraki iltung'ana, naa keramat ninche olorere, eisiaai ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu eisiaayia ninche te dukuya inkaitin enye oo nkitanyaanyukot neaku ninche ilooibooyo ng'ok te nkaji e Israel, neaku ainosa olmumai te ninche, ejo Olaitoriani Enkai, inchere kenap ninche maate enkitamioto enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maapuonu ninche aanyikaki nanu aaisiai nanu anaa ilapolosak, arashu epuonu aanyikaki intokitin aainei sinyat o ntokitin naa sinyat oleng; kake kenap ninche enkurruna enye, te nkaraki ilo minong otaasa ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake sii naa kagelu ninche meitasheiki ina aji e Nkai, peyie atum aas esiaai pooki naasi tiatua ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilapolosak",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kake ore ilapolosak loo Lawi, lelo ayiok le Sadok, lelo oogolie ewueji ai sinyati, ina kata nashomo iltung'ana le Israel aapong'ori aaing'uaa nanu, kepuonu ninche enatii aanyiku peyie aasiai nanu, naa kaaisiaai nanu aaitaiki nanu nena naapir tenebo ilo sarge, ejo Olaitoriani Enkai; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa kejing ninche ewueji ai Sinyati, naa kejing ninche emisa ai, peyie aaisiai nanu, naa keibung ninche enkitanapata ai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.28.39+EXO.28.40+EXO.28.41+EXO.28.42+EXO.28.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 28.39-43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.16.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 16.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore peyie ejing ninche atua inchomito o lgoriet liatua, naa keishop ninche inkilani e kitani naapuyiapui; meishop hoo ninche toki naitobiruno too lpapit loo ntare, ina kata aaisiaai too nchomito o lgoriet tiatua aji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa keishop ninche inkarash e kitani too lukuny enye o surualini e kitani too mpolosi enye; merrotian ninche ae toki naitaar ninche enkima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.16.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 16.23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naa tenebo eipang aapuo olodung'oro lioriong enetii iltung'ana, naa keitayu nena kilani nena apa naaisiaaishore, neirragie ninche too lgilat sinyat; neishop ninche kulie kilani, pee mepik ake esinyatisho iltung'ana too nkilani enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.21.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 21.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nemebarn ninche ilukuny enye aarashu eisho ilpapit lenye ebulu aadoru, keisor ake ninche ilpapit lenye loo lukuny enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.10.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 10.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Meetae olapolosani ook enaisho oo sabibu, ina kata ejing olgoriet liatua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.21.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 21.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.21.13+LEV.21.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "13-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Meyam ninche enkoliai, arashu enkitok natung'uayie o lpayian lenye, kake eselenkei ake o lorere le nkaji e Israel, arashu enkoliai naa enkoliai o lapolosani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
