        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.10.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 10.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Keiteng'en ninche iltung'ana laainei enepaashare ina nasinya o ina nemesinya, neitodol ninche eneiko teneirishu ina naiduruk o enemeiduruk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore tembae pooki natii enchankar, neaku ninche ilarishak te risioroto oo nkiguanat aainei. Keibung ninche inkitanapat aainei tenebo inkiguanat too siruai laainei pooki gelunot, neitisiny isabatoni aainei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.21.1+LEV.21.2+LEV.21.3+LEV.21.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 21.1-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Meisarkionie ninche ate aapuo aanyikaki olmeneng'ani; ore ake eyia, te papaai arashu yieyioo to layioni arashu te ntito, to lalashe arashu teina anashe nemeyama keidim aaisarkionie ate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore peyie eidip aiduruko, neikenaki kewan nkolong'i naapishana neaku ninye olemeeta olduruk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore teina olong nalo ninye ine wueji sinyati, atua olgoriet liaatua, peyie aaisiai tiatua ewueji sinyati, naa keitayu ninye olasar lenye le ng'oki ejo, Olaitoriani Enkai,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
